 units were built of the Panzer II A, B and C series  from 1937 to 1940. By the end of 1942 the Panzer II was primarily removed from front line services, however the turrets from Panzer I and IIs were reused for defensive purposes in bunkers, particularly in the Atlantic Wall.","LocalizedString":"The Panzer II-C was a variant in the Panzerkampfwagen II series (abbreviation PzKpfw II), a German light tank that was used by the Axis from 1937 to 1945. The tank had a crew of 3 (commander/gunner, driver and loader), a main armament of 1 x 2 cm KwK 30 L/55 and a secondary armament of 1 x 7.92 mm Maschinengewehr 34 (e. machine gun 34). A total of 1,113 units were built of the Panzer II A, B and C series  from 1937 to 1940. By the end of 1942 the Panzer II was primarily removed from front line services, however the turrets from Panzer I and IIs were reused for defensive purposes in bunkers, particularly in the Atlantic Wall."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Expansion2019","isInPermanentPool":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardBecomingVeteran"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Veteran"],"draftBaseWeight":1.2,"soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Silence'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Silence/Silence.0"},"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_Exp_Armor_Medium_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Card_Blowups/AU_Exp_Armor_Medium_Cue.0"},"soundProjectileImpact":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Silence'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Silence/Silence.0"},"soundProjectileFiring":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Silence'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Silence/Silence.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/t_panzer_ii_512px.t_panzer_ii_512px","SubPathString":""},"ImageAnchor":"EImageAnchor::Top","artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/PANZER_II-C.P